{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vtuber &quot;Aoi Neno&quot; was taking a nap in her room. When she woke up, she was on an unfamiliar beach. Suddenly feeling something was off, she looked over the water and saw herself wearing an apron! Will she be able to find a clue to get back to her room while experiencing various jobs? There are five mini-games that can be played using only the keyboard (memorization game, explosive game, quiz game) and a novel game part. Once you have cleared all the mini-games, you will be able to play the final stage (a shooting game). Maybe something good will happen if you clear it to the end...?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761510?t=1751246803","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761510/465285794f971cf41772c6f49a9c661f48b5494b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751246803","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761510/dbff5311aa82c41bf7dfa17fe0fc612938729add/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751246803","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761510/dbff5311aa82c41bf7dfa17fe0fc612938729add/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751246803","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vtuber &quot;Aoi Neno&quot; was taking a nap in her room. When she woke up, she was on an unfamiliar beach. Suddenly feeling something was off, she looked over the water and saw herself wearing an apron! Will she be able to find a clue to get back to her room while experiencing various jobs? There are five mini-games that can be played using only the keyboard (memorization game, explosive game, quiz game) and a novel game part. Once you have cleared all the mini-games, you will be able to play the final stage (a shooting game). Maybe something good will happen if you clear it to the end...?<